<td style="vertical-align:top" align="center">13,424</td></tr>
</table> <p style="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman">Based on the foregoing votes, both Proposal 1 and Proposal 2 were approved. No other matters were submitted to or voted on by the Company&#8217;s stockholders at the Meeting. </p>
